Content-Disposition: form-data; name="explanation"

The original source identities rewrite every fixed weight as the corresponding logarithmic row weight.  Source admissibility makes each weight positive, while all multi-index coordinates are natural numbers; the defining finite sum is therefore nonnegative.
------p2mBoundary7f3a9c2b
